	Virtual Quest, History

 06-07-92 V1.00

      ° Were never officialy released due to the lack of functions

 06-08-92 V1.02

      ° The first released version! The most of the functions I had planned
	were inplemented but I will add some more in the next version!

 06-09-92 V1.03

      ° A User can now read his old application, a separate security status
	for that was added in the config file, a bug was fixed! When a user
	had chosen that his answers was NOT correct he was added as a new
	user for every time he took No.. And it was the same with the log
	file but it's fixed now! A bug found then a user was in Quest and
	of some reason got loss off carrier he would be among the new users
	but his answer file would not exist and the program would then crash!
	The program now checks if the file exists before trying to open it!

 06-19-92 V1.06

      ° Fixed the bug with the questionary! It now works as it was explained
	in the manual.. Fixed bug when the program showed an application.

      ° Fixed bug when a user took ? in the sysop menues 2.. It wouldn't dir
	all users only about half of them..

      ° Added an extra option in the config file from wich the sysop now can
	terrorise the user if the user don't answers all questions.. The prg
	will whenever a user just presses return and doesn't write anything
	write a text that says that the user must enter the questions and then
	will the program ask the questions again! Very usefull against lazy
	users.. hehe

      ° Added & Fixed so then the user had answered all the questions he/she
	must either press Y or N to continue, before if you pressed return
	it only meant the same as a N and some of my users didn't like that..

      ° Added in a new sysop command! You can now DELETE a users applications
	ie if you think the users hasn't answered it seriously or something
	like that! You also must enter a password to do so which you can
	change in the config file!

 04-07-92 V1.07

      ° The users name is now fully displayed even if it consists of spaces
	this has been a nasty bug all the time but I didn't know how to fix
	it until now..

      ° If you list all the applications it will know display it two & two
	it was a bit hard to read before, it took all day..

      ° File note will now append the whole name but if it consists of spaces
	it will replace each space with a '-'..

      ° The routine to read applications who was saved with the answers only
	was optimized and works much faster!

      ° All menues and texts has been optimized and you will see a large
	speed inprovment in the program!!!

      ° Some minor bugs was fixed but you will probably not notice any
	difference at all.

      ° Different questionarys at the same time added! Ie if you have used
	the function save answers only and you want to change your questionary
	you will doubtless get into some serious trouble.. You either have to
	change all your application by youself (huu) or use this new version
	of Quest which keeps track on from wich questionary the answers came!
	If you have old applications quest will simple enough take it for
	granted that they where questioned by questions.1! If you now want
	a new questionary just create a new one and name it questions.2 and
	put it in the same dir as questions.1, then you only has got to change
	the deafult questionary in the config file to 2! (The variabel
	Questionary in the file Quest.CFG)

 07-10-92 V1.08

      ° The delete password is now not displayed on the screen when you
	write it in, there will only be * displayed instead of each char!

      ° A bunch of bugs fixed & the list all applications routine was
	optimized again and is now even faster...

      ° Added in so Quest will write a line in the callerslog if anyone
	deletes the new users log or a users application and of course in
	colour!

 08-11-92 V1.09

      ° You can now search for an application with the users name instead
	of only the slot number.

      ° The listening routine for all users has been redone and is now
	much faster. It gets it's info from the log file nowadays.

      ° All external Dos commands where changed to use internal functions
	that are built in the Rexxsyslib.library, thus the FileNote command
	are still loaded from CLI so please have paitience with that.

      ° Many bugs where changed and some unneccessary crap was removed from
	the source! This time it shall WORK!

      ° This version is only an apetizer for version V1.10 with built in
	account ed! So please hold on..

 05-01-93 V1.10 Major Update for /X 2.35+

      ° Finaly the time for an update has come and it has been worth waiting
	for. What have happened is that all sysop commands has been built in
	to Account ED instead for more efficient and faster user updates.
	Therefor has that code been removed from Quest, and the remaining
	code has been optimized and sometime rewritten. Here are the new
	features!
      ° Added in MCI like commands that will show certain info from the
	questionary in the users account (using Account ED) in comming versions
	of Account ED, this feature is only built in Quest today, but soon
	in Account ED too more info in the Doc file.
      ° All configuration values now are loaded from Account Ed's preset file
	AccEd.Presets
      ° Built in automatic user upgrader so your user can automatically gain
	access after answering the questions. They will get the first preset
	inte the AccEd.Presets file if this function is turned on.
      ° Forces all new users to write a letter to sysop about themselves thru
	an built in mail program
      ° Automatically hangs up after the user answered all questions and
	written the letter to sysop if not AutoAccess is on
      ° Gives the user a opurtunity to operate sysop before it hangs up
      ° Drops carrier if a user press a defined number of returns
      ° Prompts that the user must answer all questions if a user press return
	and ask the question again (it's configurable)
      ° Automatically deletes the questionary which may exists on the new
	users slot number and moves the one deleted questionary to the QuestDel
	directory and renames it to the users name who answered it so there
	will never be a problem if you forgets to delete a users questionary
	you've deleted!
      ° Old users who answers the questions will not be thrown out and
	doesn't have to write a letter to sysop. Usefull if you wan't all
	your old users to answer you questions with quest instead
      ° Code optimized and almost rewritten

